false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:39:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T15:46:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124194.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #117680\r\n\r\nThe bug I saw in that issue was that when a mesh had the ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS flag set, then the values in BONE_INDICES and BONE_WEIGHTS were incorrect. It seemed like it received a list containing groups of 8 values but was still treating it like groups of 4. So the value of BONE_INDICES for vertex 1 is correct, but the value of BONE_INDICES for vertex 2 is just the next four values for vertex 1, and so on.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI found two locations where a skin_stride variable was incremented by `4 * sizeof(int16_t)` without checking for the value of the flag. Changing those to use 8 instead of 4 in the case that ARRAY_FLAG_USE_8_BONE_WEIGHTS was set, seems to let the shader render correctly.\r\n\r\nIn one of those locations, there's a `attribs[i].size = 4;` and I tried also setting that to 8 when the flag is set, but it would cause crashes, and from testing it doesn't appear necessary to fix this issue.\r\n\r\nI've created a minimal test project that shows the issue this is trying to solve:\r\n\r\n[bone_indices_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33071010/bone_indices_test.zip)\r\n\r\nI've also tried out some other skinned meshes and haven't encountered bugs introduced by this.\r\n\r\nAfter this fix, BONE_INDICES and BONE_WEIGHTS in the shader contain the first four values rather than all eight, but getting the correct four values, I think is more important than getting all eight. I was using a shader to visually highlight a targeted bone, and the values are ordered from highest weight to lowest weight, so getting the first four would have been fine for my use.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124194/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124194/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}